{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16010","headline":"送衣曲 · 王建","name":"送衣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去秋送衣渡黄河，今秋送衣上陇坂。\n妇人不知道径处，但问新移军近远。\n半年着道经雨湿，开笼见风衣领急。\n旧来十月初点衣，与郎着向营中集。\n絮时厚厚绵纂纂，贵欲征人身上暖。\n愿身莫着裹屍归，愿妾不死长送衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}